      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "The Big Bang Theory Theme",
          "start_time": 0.0,
          "end_time": 2.05,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Our whole universe was in a hot dense state,",
          "start_time": 2.05,
          "end_time": 4.875,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "宇宙一度又烫又稠密",
          "start_time": 2.05,
          "end_time": 4.875,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Then nearly fourteen billion years ago expansion started.     Wait...",
          "start_time": 4.875,
          "end_time": 9.6,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "140亿年前终于爆了炸 等着瞧...",
          "start_time": 4.875,
          "end_time": 9.6,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "The Earth began to cool,",
          "start_time": 9.6,
          "end_time": 11.6,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "地球开始降温",
          "start_time": 9.6,
          "end_time": 11.6,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "The autotrophs began to drool,",
          "start_time": 11.6,
          "end_time": 13.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "自养生物来起哄",
          "start_time": 11.6,
          "end_time": 13.925,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Neanderthals developed tools,",
          "start_time": 13.925,
          "end_time": 16.225,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "尼安德特人发明工具",
          "start_time": 13.925,
          "end_time": 16.225,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "We built a wall (we built the pyramids),",
          "start_time": 16.225,
          "end_time": 18.975,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "我们建长城（我们建金字塔）",
          "start_time": 16.225,
          "end_time": 18.975,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Math, science, history, unraveling the mystery,",
          "start_time": 18.975,
          "end_time": 22.6,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "数学 自然科学 历史 揭开神秘",
          "start_time": 18.975,
          "end_time": 22.6,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "That all started with the big bang!",
          "start_time": 22.6,
          "end_time": 24.85,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "一切由大爆炸开始",
          "start_time": 22.6,
          "end_time": 24.85,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Since \"the dawn of man\" is really not that long,",
          "start_time": 24.85,
          "end_time": 28.0,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "其实人类历史没有多久",
          "start_time": 24.85,
          "end_time": 28.0,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "As every galaxy was formed in less time than it takes to sing this song.",
          "start_time": 28.0,
          "end_time": 32.75,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "星系形成时间比唱完这支歌还要短",
          "start_time": 28.0,
          "end_time": 32.75,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "A fraction of a second and the elements were made.",
          "start_time": 32.75,
          "end_time": 36.025,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "元素在微秒间便形成了",
          "start_time": 32.75,
          "end_time": 36.025,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "The bipeds stood up straight,",
          "start_time": 36.025,
          "end_time": 38.1,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "两足动物直立行走",
          "start_time": 36.025,
          "end_time": 38.1,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "The dinosaurs all met their fate,",
          "start_time": 38.1,
          "end_time": 40.5,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "恐龙都得认命了",
          "start_time": 38.1,
          "end_time": 40.5,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "They tried to leap but they were late",
          "start_time": 40.5,
          "end_time": 42.975,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "想要突变 没来得及",
          "start_time": 40.5,
          "end_time": 42.975,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "And they all died (they froze their asses off)",
          "start_time": 42.975,
          "end_time": 46.025,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "就死光光了（pp都冻成了化石）",
          "start_time": 42.975,
          "end_time": 46.025,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "The oceans and pangea",
          "start_time": 46.025,
          "end_time": 48.0,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "大洋和泛古陆",
          "start_time": 46.025,
          "end_time": 48.0,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "See ya, wouldn't wanna be ya",
          "start_time": 48.0,
          "end_time": 50.25,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "拜拜 才不想学你",
          "start_time": 48.0,
          "end_time": 50.25,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Set in motion by the same big bang!",
          "start_time": 50.25,
          "end_time": 52.85,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "都是爆炸惹的祸",
          "start_time": 50.25,
          "end_time": 52.85,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "It all started with the big BANG!",
          "start_time": 52.85,
          "end_time": 55.125,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "一切从大爆炸开始",
          "start_time": 52.85,
          "end_time": 55.125,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "It's expanding ever outward but one day",
          "start_time": 55.125,
          "end_time": 57.975,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "宇宙向外膨胀 但有一天",
          "start_time": 55.125,
          "end_time": 57.975,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "It will cause the stars to go the other way,",
          "start_time": 57.975,
          "end_time": 60.85,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "星球会反方向运动",
          "start_time": 57.975,
          "end_time": 60.85,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Collapsing ever inward, we won't be here, it wont be hurt",
          "start_time": 60.85,
          "end_time": 64.55,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "向内坍塌 反正我们不在了 不会觉得疼",
          "start_time": 60.85,
          "end_time": 64.55,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Our best and brightest figure that it'll make an even bigger bang!",
          "start_time": 64.55,
          "end_time": 68.77499999999999,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "我们美好光辉的形象将引发一场更大的爆炸",
          "start_time": 64.55,
          "end_time": 68.77499999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Australopithecus would really have been sick of us",
          "start_time": 68.77499999999999,
          "end_time": 72.02499999999999,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "南方古猿肯定很讨厌我们",
          "start_time": 68.77499999999999,
          "end_time": 72.02499999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Debating out while here they're catching deer (we're catching viruses)",
          "start_time": 72.02499999999999,
          "end_time": 76.14999999999999,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "在他们捉鹿时唧唧歪歪 （我们现在改抓电脑病毒啦）",
          "start_time": 72.02499999999999,
          "end_time": 76.14999999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Religion or astronomy, Descartes , Deuteronomy",
          "start_time": 76.14999999999999,
          "end_time": 79.74999999999999,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "宗教 天文学 笛卡尔 旧约申命记",
          "start_time": 76.14999999999999,
          "end_time": 79.74999999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 89.925,
          "end_time": 89.925,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
